{"item_id":"youtube:htK1TbVFpt4","version_id":"9a928ef80766cafe4303896e0db49353a4219ec2a75376f433f56c7df84d72ba","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this is primarily mule deer hunting narrative and stalking tactics, with no substantive gear testing transferable to Mammoth. The advertiser-supported publisher praises OnX and features its employee and their decade-long working relationship; the mapping discussion and passing tripod praise do not establish supported gear suitability.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:Ck_LLOSRdk0","version_id":"eff78ec95adb20a4c17f1436b64b4a5a3a5757663073d84beeaea9ff3b02bea0","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, the supplied text contains only “so” and provides no in-scope gear content or connection to Mammoth conditions. Commercial incentives identifies the publisher as advertiser supported, but no specific commercial relationship is established in this item's text.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"youtube:euc3l6kCUZI","version_id":"00a14db141c8b0f9c9c62b4ba5dd8b4cd15cf971260aa8f88fd38c06f54f160e","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Making the decision and Credibility, this manufacturer introduction supplies only music and repeated “Heat,” making it a promotional post without substantive specifications or testing. Commercial incentives also requires flagging Gatorz's Vortex collaboration and resulting connection to Mammoth's title sponsor.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"podcast:c219e3c1-b26c-4c37-882b-759af3f892df","version_id":"706d57c181a240186c295b4643878e60ca99444061848ae779b70d1546c83cba","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Making the decision, Brooks's newly reported account of temperature-logged nights around zero to seven degrees, draft-collar adjustments, and a described treated-versus-untreated down immersion comparison provides citable evidence relevant to carried sleep systems, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Commercial incentives and Uncertainty require identifying Argali's product-development interest and Vortex's title-sponsor role, attributing these results as manufacturer-reported experience rather than independent validation, and withholding broad durability or treatment conclusions pending independent evidence.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
